# Ping Pong Board

Read `AGENTS.md` for full architecture. Summary:

- Express 5 + vanilla HTML/CSS/JS, **no build step**
- SQLite persistence (`better-sqlite3`), not in-memory
- Real-time via SSE (`/api/events`); full state broadcast on toggle
- 18 slots (09:00–17:30), names max 12 chars, `localStorage` key `pp-name`
- Single OpenShift replica with PVC; daily clear via CronJob → `POST /api/clear`

When editing:
- Minimize scope; match existing code style
- Do not add frameworks, bundlers, or TypeScript
- Do not add auth — nicknames are self-reported
- Keep `server.js` and inline `index.html` JS in sync on API contracts
